    "text": "By Steve LeMaster Sports Writer ,\n9 hours ago Perry County Central is set to visit North Laurel for its opening game in the 2026 high school football season on Friday, Aug. 21. The Commodores hosted the Jaguars for a 2025 high school football season opener. North Laurel shut out Perry County Central in the two high school football teams' last meeting on Friday, Aug. 22, 2025. Read full article",
